### ===================================
### Variables
### ===================================

@host = http://localhost:8000
@contentType = application/json

### ===================================
### Auth
### ===================================

# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/token/ HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "username": "jorgemgr94",
  "password": "[PASSWORD]"
}

### Capture token from login response
@token = {{login.response.body.access}}

### ===================================
### Protected Endpoints (examples)
### ===================================

### Get all organizations
GET {{host}}/api/v1/organizations/ HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create organization
POST {{host}}/api/v1/organizations/ HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Test 3",
  "email": "test3@gmail.com"
}